  "name": "First-Class Experimental Teleporter: free capitals, 8 gold everywhere else",
  "contract": "The First-Class Experimental Teleporter (gameobject 323232, gossip text 61004) shows the live server's menu: the character's two faction capitals (Stormwind and Ironforge, or Orgrimmar and Undercity) for free, then Western Plaguelands, Winterspring, Burning Steppes, Silithus, Un'Goro Crater, Azshara and Booty Bay for 8 gold each. Every option carries its picture (the mage teleport icon for a capital, the zone's achievement icon otherwise) at 64 pixels, and a paid one reads 'Name - 8' with the gold coin icon. A paid jump is refused without the money, charging nothing; a capital needs none. A jump starts 985513 'Experimental Teleporter', a 5 minute recharge during which the teleporter refuses with a notice. A city jump lands at the city's teleport point; a zone jump drops the character 120 yards above the zone's point with Parachute 45472, applied after arrival when the jump crosses continents. The first jump completes Path to Ascension tutorial 31 and its achievement 87230.",
